  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math> là điểm thuộc cạnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> sao cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó góc giữa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> bằng góc giữa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Giả sử <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là tứ diện đều có cạnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là tứ diện đều nên \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>21</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tTam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>21</mn></msqrt><mn>42</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra góc giữa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>≈</mo><mn>83</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/99ec0787537ba4354ad09a7c928878603fa4547e3f153812f6f86219478f632a.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
